<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY UNION-NSW BEAT NORTHERN TRANSVAAL 43-29.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-NSW BEAT NORTHERN TRANSVAAL 43-29.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>New South Wales beat Northern Transvaal 43-29 (halftime 24-7) in a Super 12 rugby union match at the Sydney Football Stadium on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>New South Wales - Tries: Matthew Burke (3), Fili Finau, Graeme Bond. Conversions: Burke (3). Penalties: Burke (4).</p>
<p>Northern Transvaal - Tries: Henry Tromp, Graham Bouwer, Andre Snyman, Kosi Alberts, Jacques Olivier. Conversions: Bouwer (2).</p>
<p>Attendance: 26,245.</p>
</text>
